# Google Places — live reviews on /reviews and the home page.
#
# Both values are required; without them the site falls back to the bundled
# sample reviews and labels them as such.
#
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY
#   Google Cloud Console -> Credentials -> Create API key.
#   Enable: "Maps JavaScript API" and "Places API (New)".
#   Restrict it by HTTP referrer to your domains — this key ships in the
#   client bundle, so referrer restriction is what protects it.
#
# VITE_GOOGLE_PLACE_ID
#   Not the CID from the Maps URL. Find it with Google's Place ID Finder:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/places/web-service/place-id
#   It looks like ChIJ....
#
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
VITE_GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=
